# /etc/conf/modreg.d/a4091 -- the a4091 module package's defaults
# (amix-dlm C3-5 sec 1): one `param <name>=<value>` per default other than
# the module's own, `disable` to ship it off.  None: the package keeps the
# module's own intr=-1 (auto: completion on the interrupt when the C4-7
# limits were accepted and its self-test passes, else polled; param intr=1
# the interrupt always, intr=0 polled always) and limits=1 (the limits
# declared; param limits=0 declares none).  Local settings belong in /etc/conf/modreg.local.d/a4091,
# which no package owns.
